OL,4,CThefts from woman with Alzheimer's     
OL,5,Cdevastate family                       
OL,6,GThe family of a woman who had early    
OL,7,Gonset Alzheimer's when her partner     
OL,8,Gstole thousands of pounds from her     
OL,9,Ghave said his crimes have "devastated" 
OL,10,Gtheir family.                          
OL,12,FDavid Brinded, 62, of Eaton, Norwich,  
OL,13,Fwas sentenced to 32 months in prison   
OL,14,Ffor fraud by abuse of position at      
OL,15,FNorwich Crown Court on Wednesday,      
OL,16,Fafter he was found to have taken       
OL,17,F#21,500 from Rosalind Jeczalik to fund 
OL,18,Fhis lifestyle.                         
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
