OL,4,CReview set into scrapped car park      
OL,5,Cdevelopment plans                      
OL,6,GThe leader of Huntingdonshire District 
OL,7,GCouncil has confirmed there will be an 
OL,8,Gindependent review into abandoned      
OL,9,Gplans to build homes on town centre    
OL,10,Gcar park sites.                        
OL,12,FProposals were formally dropped at a   
OL,13,Fcouncil meeting this week, after 90%   
OL,14,Fof residents in a survey said they did 
OL,15,Fnot want it.                           
OL,17,FThe council commissioned developer     
OL,18,FCapital and Centric to come up with    
OL,19,Fregeneration plans. More than #1m was  
OL,20,Fspent on developing proposals and      
OL,21,Fconsulting with local residents.       
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
